Perform on –site inspections in terms of risk based supervision approach and write a report;
Attend to enquiries and investigate complaints from the general public;
Maintain a comprehensive database of information of the CIS managers, collective investment schemes and portfolios, and compilation of reports to users;
Assist with projects identified by the Manager;
Engage with internal and external regulatory stakeholders to co-ordinate supervisory activities; and
Attend to administrative duties.
